Become a Franchise Owner of a Recruiting Firm!  Maximize your earnings and control your future!  

Here are some additional reasons why you should franchise:

* BE YOUR OWN BOSS:  Tired of working for someone else?  Fed up with office politics, set office hours or lack of flexibility?  Start your own Motivera franchise and become your own boss.  

* BUSINESS IN A BOX:  It can take years to understand the intricacies of the temporary employment, never mind identify reliable vendors and secure financing for payroll.  Instead, for a nominal fee, you have everything in place so you can hit the ground running.

* MAXIMIZE YOUR PROFITS:  No more making money for someone else or being paid a fraction of your production.   

* WORK/LIFE BALANCE:  As a business owner, there are no more set hours or punching a clock.   You work based on the hours and schedule that fits your life.  

WHY MOTIVERA?

* CHEAPER BUY-IN:  Motivera has a much lower buy in and royalty fees than our competition.

