The firm was built around a simple idea... that strong hiring decisions come from understanding the work itself, not just matching keywords on a resume.

With a background in audit and professional services recruiting, we approach search with a practical lens. We understand how these roles function inside organizations, what separates average from high-performing talent, and how to evaluate candidates beyond surface-level experience.

What We Do
We work with companies on important hires where the cost of getting it wrong is high.

That can include building out a finance team, replacing a key leader, or adding specialized talent in areas that are difficult to source through traditional channels.

On the candidate side, we work with experienced professionals who are thinking carefully about their next move... not just looking for a job, but looking for the right opportunity.

How We Work
Our approach is deliberate and selective.

